msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そういえば、⟪k:3⟫どこぞの舞台裏でも女中がカンペを持ってたわね。"

#: omake:omake_0C1A5A5D_E844_492A_B3FC_6EB72EA38AB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
