#: omake:omake_C735FC1D_0557_4962_A5BB_14F11B1C53E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14343d497aa11c5458b09530543e9430273bf87ff770f67721a963c719ea63ef
