msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is true... ⟪k:2⟫At first, Mell seemed like a fairly likable young man,⟪k:3⟫but by "
"the end of his chapter, he had revealed himself as a helplessly worthless child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫確かに……、⟪k:2⟫メルは人の好さそうな青年だったが、⟪k:3⟫最後に割とどうしようもない台詞を吐"
"いていた……。"

