#: omake:omake_FA818BD6_BB3B_4F25_9C0C_5DBC194FFB00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33345b783626976c6226d35f0e58d573881404af1894d61b803c7c590d2406e9
