msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor do I really think of myself that way.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m hardly a paragon of virtue..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それに、⟪k:1⟫自分のことをそんな風には感じられない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私もそれなりにやらかしているか"
"ら……。"

#: omake:omake_144794EF_6F90_4486_983B_6646972FE572
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3c6d6f0d80eddab8c1b36479b91c186097aae307a508a4782710540b7f0e9ba
